                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.041/8: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-08-30T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                                1927—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>133. Your 213, August 27, 4 p.m. Last sentence. Cable briefly reasons why
                    Liberals are objecting to procedure outlined.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
